'''Audiovisual art''' is the exploration of kinetic [[abstract art]] and music or sound set in relation to each other. It includes 
[[visual music]], [[abstract film]], audiovisual [[performances]] and [[Installation art|installations]]. {{citation needed|date=November 2012}}

